#: panner.cpp:77
msgid "Scroll left"
msgstr "Sulğa çorna"

#: panner.cpp:78
msgid "Scroll right"
msgstr "Uñğa çorna"

#: panner.cpp:91
msgid "Scroll up"
msgstr "Öskä çorna"

#: panner.cpp:92
msgid "Scroll down"
msgstr "Asqa çorna"

#. i18n: file kickerSettings.kcfg line 14
#: rc.cpp:3
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"When this option is enabled, the panels may not be moved and items cannot be "
"removed or added"
msgstr ""
"Bu köylämä açıq bulsa, bu tiräne dä küçerep bulmas, anıñ keremnären dä "
"östäp/töşerep bulmayaçaq"

#. i18n: file kickerSettings.kcfg line 19
#: rc.cpp:6
#, no-c-format
msgid "Enable conserve space"
msgstr "Alan saqlawın cibärergä"

#. i18n: file kickerSettings.kcfg line 24
#: rc.cpp:9
#, no-c-format
msgid "Enable transparency"
msgstr "Ütäkürenmäle itäse"

#. i18n: file kickerSettings.kcfg line 25
#: rc.cpp:12
#, no-c-format
msgid "When this option is enabled, the panel will become pseudo-transparent"
msgstr "Bu köylämä açıq bulsa, bu tirä astlığı yasalma ütäkürenüçän itäläçäk"

#. i18n: file kickerSettings.kcfg line 30
#: rc.cpp:15
#, no-c-format
msgid "Enable transparency for menubar panel"
msgstr "Saylaqtirä öçen utäkürenüne açası"

#. i18n: file kickerSettings.kcfg line 31
#: rc.cpp:18
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"When this option is enabled, the panel containing the menubar will become "
"pseudo-transparent as well"
msgstr ""
"Bu köylämä açıq bulsa, saylaq yatqan tirä astlığı yasalma ütäkürenüçän itäläçäk"

#. i18n: file kickerSettings.kcfg line 36
#: rc.cpp:21
#, no-c-format
msgid "Enable background image"
msgstr "Asyaq süräten qullanası"

#. i18n: file kickerSettings.kcfg line 37
#: rc.cpp:24
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"When this option is enabled, the panel will display a tiled image as its "
"background"
msgstr "Bu köylämä açıq bulsa, bu tirä astlığında sürät tüşälgän bulaçaq"

#. i18n: file kickerSettings.kcfg line 42
#: rc.cpp:27
#, no-c-format
msgid "Enable colourized background."
msgstr "Tösle asyaq qullanası."

#. i18n: file kickerSettings.kcfg line 47
#: rc.cpp:30
#, no-c-format
msgid "Rotate background"
msgstr "Asyaqnı borıp quy"

#. i18n: file kickerSettings.kcfg line 48
#: rc.cpp:33
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"When this option is enabled, when the panel is placed on the side or top edges "
"of the screen, the background image will be rotated to match the panel's "
"orientation"
msgstr ""
"Bu köylämä açıq bulsa, bu tirä küräkneñ yannarında yä ki östendä bulğan çaqta, "
"anıñ artyaq sürätetiräneñ yünälüenä qarap borılğan bulaçaq."

#. i18n: file kickerSettings.kcfg line 53
#: rc.cpp:36
#, no-c-format
msgid "Background image"
msgstr "Asyaq süräte"

#. i18n: file kickerSettings.kcfg line 54
#: rc.cpp:39
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Here you can choose an image to be displayed on the panel. Press the 'browse' "
"button to choose a theme using the file dialog. This option is only effective "
"if 'Enable background image' is selected"
msgstr ""
"Bu tirädä kürsätäse sürätne bonda saylap bula. Berär tışlawnı birem açı "
"täräzäse qullanıp saylaw öçen 'browse' töymäsenä çirtäse. 'Asyaq süräten "
"qullanası' saylanğan bulsa ğına bu köylämä eşläyäçäk."

#. i18n: file kickerSettings.kcfg line 59
#: rc.cpp:42
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Controls the saturation level of the tint color used with transparent panels"
msgstr "Ütäkürenüle tirä qullanğan tözmerneñ quyılığın üzgärtä"

#. i18n: file kickerSettings.kcfg line 66
#: rc.cpp:45
#, no-c-format
msgid "The tint color used to colorize transparent panels"
msgstr "Ütäkürenmäle tirälärdä qullanası tös"

#. i18n: file kickerSettings.kcfg line 68
#: rc.cpp:48
#, no-c-format
msgid "This option sets the color to use when tinting transparent panels"
msgstr "Ütäkürenmäle tirälär töslägändä qullanası tös bilgeläwçe köylämä"

#. i18n: file kickerSettings.kcfg line 72
#: rc.cpp:51
#, no-c-format
msgid "Raise when the pointer touches the screen here"
msgstr "Uq küräkneñ bu cirgä tisä kütär"

#. i18n: file kickerSettings.kcfg line 77
#: rc.cpp:54
#, no-c-format
msgid "Fade out applet handles"
msgstr "Applet totqıçların äkren yuq itü"

#. i18n: file kickerSettings.kcfg line 79
#: rc.cpp:57
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Select this option to make applet handles only visible on mouse hover. Applet "
"handles let you move, remove and configure applets."
msgstr ""
"Östennän küşe ütkändä genä bu applet totqıçların kürsätü öçen bu köylämäne "
"yanıq itäse. Applet totqıçları anı küçerergä, beterergä, caylarğa birä."

#. i18n: file kickerSettings.kcfg line 83
#: rc.cpp:60
#, no-c-format
msgid "Hide applet handles"
msgstr "Applet totqıçların yäşert"

#. i18n: file kickerSettings.kcfg line 85
#: rc.cpp:63
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Select this option to always hide the applet handles. Beware this could disable "
"moving, removing or configuring some applets."
msgstr ""
"Bu applet totqıçların barçaqta yäşertü öçen bu köylämäne yanıq itäse. Alay "
"bulsa applet küçerü, beterü, caylaw eşläre sünek bulaçaq."

#. i18n: file kickerSettings.kcfg line 89
#: rc.cpp:66
#, no-c-format
msgid "Show informational tooltips"
msgstr "Yärdämçel qoralkiñäş kürsätü"

#. i18n: file kickerSettings.kcfg line 94
#: rc.cpp:69
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"A list of applets that have been loaded at runtime. In the case of a crash "
"these applets will not be loaded at the next Kicker start, in case they caused "
"the crash"
msgstr ""
"Çınçorta yöklise applet tezmäse. Alardan berärse cimerelügä kiterä ikän, "
"Kicker'neñ kiläse cibärelüendä ul applet yöklänmäyäçäk inde."

#. i18n: file kickerSettings.kcfg line 98
#: rc.cpp:72
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"A list of extensions that have been loaded at runtime. In the case of a crash "
"these extensions will not be loaded at the next Kicker start, in case they "
"caused the crash"
msgstr ""
"Çınçorta yöklise quşılma tezmäse. Alardan berärse cimerelügä kiterä ikän, "
"Kicker'neñ kiläse cibärelüendä ul quşılma yöklänmäyäçäk inde."

#. i18n: file kickerSettings.kcfg line 108
#: rc.cpp:75
#, no-c-format
msgid "Show simple menu entries"
msgstr "Ciñel saylaq keremnären kürsätäse"

#. i18n: file kickerSettings.kcfg line 111
#: rc.cpp:78
#, no-c-format
msgid "Show names first on detailed entries"
msgstr "Centekle keremnär başında adın kürsätäse"

#. i18n: file kickerSettings.kcfg line 114
#: rc.cpp:81
#, no-c-format
msgid "Show only description for menu entries"
msgstr "Saylaq keremnäre öçen açıqlama ğına kürsätäse"

#. i18n: file kickerSettings.kcfg line 117
#: rc.cpp:84
#, no-c-format
msgid "Show detailed menu entries"
msgstr "Centekle saylaq keremnär kürsätäse"

#. i18n: file kickerSettings.kcfg line 121
#: rc.cpp:87
#, no-c-format
msgid "Formation of the menu entry text"
msgstr "Saylaq kerem yazması tözeleşe"

#. i18n: file kickerSettings.kcfg line 125
#: rc.cpp:90
#, no-c-format
msgid "Show section titles in Kmenu"
msgstr "K-saylaqta bülek başlıqların kürsätäse"

#. i18n: file kickerSettings.kcfg line 130
#: rc.cpp:93
#, no-c-format
msgid "Height of menu entries in pixels"
msgstr "Saylaq kerem bieklege, taplap"

#. i18n: file kickerSettings.kcfg line 135
#: rc.cpp:96
#, no-c-format
msgid "Show hidden files in Quick Browser"
msgstr "Tiz Gizgeçtä yäşeren biremnär kürsätü"

#. i18n: file kickerSettings.kcfg line 140
#: rc.cpp:99
#, no-c-format
msgid "Maximum number of entries"
msgstr "&Kerem sanın çikläw"

#. i18n: file kickerSettings.kcfg line 146
#: rc.cpp:102
#, no-c-format
msgid "Show bookmarks in KMenu"
msgstr "KSaylaq'ta bitbilgelär kürsätü"

#. i18n: file kickerSettings.kcfg line 151
#: rc.cpp:105
#, no-c-format
msgid "Use the Quick Browser"
msgstr "Tiz Gizgeç qullanası"

#. i18n: file kickerSettings.kcfg line 156
#: rc.cpp:108
#, no-c-format
msgid "Optional Menus"
msgstr "Östämä Saylaqlar"

#. i18n: file kickerSettings.kcfg line 161
#: rc.cpp:111
#, no-c-format
msgid "Recently used applications"
msgstr "Baya qullanılğan yazılımnar"

#. i18n: file kickerSettings.kcfg line 165
#: rc.cpp:114
#, no-c-format
msgid "Number of visible entries"
msgstr "Kürengän keremnär sanı"

#. i18n: file kickerSettings.kcfg line 171
#: rc.cpp:117
#, no-c-format
msgid "Show most recently used applications rather than most frequently used"
msgstr ""
"İñ qullanılğan yazılımnar urınına baya qullanılğan yazılımnar kürsätäse"

#. i18n: file kickerSettings.kcfg line 180
#: rc.cpp:120
#, no-c-format
msgid "Enable a tile background image for the KMenu button"
msgstr "KSaylaq töymäse öçen asyaq süräten tüşäw qullanası"

#. i18n: file kickerSettings.kcfg line 185
#: rc.cpp:123
#, no-c-format
